#
# fork_cap_test manifest -- what a task forks away from (#945).
#
# 🔑 The grant exists to be withheld.  This task is granted the one capability
# below on its own per-task port, and a child it forks asks for the same and
# must be refused it by cap_server: the child holds no per-task port.  The id
# names no device, so the grant reaches nothing even where it is made.

name fork_cap_test

# RESOURCE_BLK_DEVICE (4), id 0x945 alone, READ (0x1).
required 4 0x945 0x1
